{"real": false, "dur": 73.84, "sent": [{"start": 0.4, "end": 7.32, "text": "There’s another idea I can use in both languages, and I think it could work in others too.", "words": [{"w": "There’s", "s": 0.4}, {"w": "another", "s": 0.78}, {"w": "idea", "s": 1.17}, {"w": "I", "s": 1.55}, {"w": "can", "s": 1.94}, {"w": "use", "s": 2.32}, {"w": "in", "s": 2.71}, {"w": "both", "s": 3.09}, {"w": "languages,", "s": 3.48}, {"w": "and", "s": 3.86}, {"w": "I", "s": 4.25}, {"w": "think", "s": 4.63}, {"w": "it", "s": 5.02}, {"w": "could", "s": 5.4}, {"w": "work", "s": 5.78}, {"w": "in", "s": 6.17}, {"w": "others", "s": 6.55}, {"w": "too.", "s": 6.94}]}, {"start": 7.67, "end": 9.98, "text": "I call it the transfer test.", "words": [{"w": "I", "s": 7.67}, {"w": "call", "s": 8.06}, {"w": "it", "s": 8.44}, {"w": "the", "s": 8.83}, {"w": "transfer", "s": 9.21}, {"w": "test.", "s": 9.6}]}, {"start": 10.33, "end": 16.87, "text": "At the end of an exercise run, I ask learners about a word they’ve never seen before.", "words": [{"w": "At", "s": 10.33}, {"w": "the", "s": 10.72}, {"w": "end", "s": 11.1}, {"w": "of", "s": 11.48}, {"w": "an", "s": 11.87}, {"w": "exercise", "s": 12.25}, {"w": "run,", "s": 12.64}, {"w": "I", "s": 13.02}, {"w": "ask", "s": 13.41}, {"w": "learners", "s": 13.79}, {"w": "about", "s": 14.18}, {"w": "a", "s": 14.56}, {"w": "word", "s": 14.95}, {"w": "they’ve", "s": 15.33}, {"w": "never", "s": 15.72}, {"w": "seen", "s": 16.1}, {"w": "before.", "s": 16.48}]}, {"start": 17.22, "end": 22.6, "text": "In French, the course teaches the masculine and feminine words for “a Chinese person.”", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 17.22}, {"w": "French,", "s": 17.6}, {"w": "the", "s": 17.99}, {"w": "course", "s": 18.37}, {"w": "teaches", "s": 18.76}, {"w": "the", "s": 19.14}, {"w": "masculine", "s": 19.53}, {"w": "and", "s": 19.91}, {"w": "feminine", "s": 20.3}, {"w": "words", "s": 20.68}, {"w": "for", "s": 21.07}, {"w": "“a", "s": 21.45}, {"w": "Chinese", "s": 21.83}, {"w": "person.”", "s": 22.22}]}, {"start": 22.95, "end": 25.26, "text": "Then it asks: what about Luxembourgish?", "words": [{"w": "Then", "s": 22.95}, {"w": "it", "s": 23.34}, {"w": "asks:", "s": 23.72}, {"w": "what", "s": 24.11}, {"w": "about", "s": 24.49}, {"w": "Luxembourgish?", "s": 24.88}]}, {"start": 25.61, "end": 27.15, "text": "Nobody taught that one.", "words": [{"w": "Nobody", "s": 25.61}, {"w": "taught", "s": 26.0}, {"w": "that", "s": 26.38}, {"w": "one.", "s": 26.77}]}, {"start": 27.5, "end": 32.88, "text": "But learners know the rule: if the word ends in -s, you add -e.", "words": [{"w": "But", "s": 27.5}, {"w": "learners", "s": 27.88}, {"w": "know", "s": 28.27}, {"w": "the", "s": 28.65}, {"w": "rule:", "s": 29.04}, {"w": "if", "s": 29.42}, {"w": "the", "s": 29.81}, {"w": "word", "s": 30.19}, {"w": "ends", "s": 30.58}, {"w": "in", "s": 30.96}, {"w": "-s,", "s": 31.35}, {"w": "you", "s": 31.73}, {"w": "add", "s": 32.12}, {"w": "-e.", "s": 32.5}]}, {"start": 33.23, "end": 37.47, "text": "So they can work out the answer by applying the rule.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 33.23}, {"w": "they", "s": 33.62}, {"w": "can", "s": 34.0}, {"w": "work", "s": 34.39}, {"w": "out", "s": 34.77}, {"w": "the", "s": 35.16}, {"w": "answer", "s": 35.54}, {"w": "by", "s": 35.93}, {"w": "applying", "s": 36.31}, {"w": "the", "s": 36.7}, {"w": "rule.", "s": 37.08}]}, {"start": 37.82, "end": 40.12, "text": "You can see it happening here.", "words": [{"w": "You", "s": 37.82}, {"w": "can", "s": 38.2}, {"w": "see", "s": 38.58}, {"w": "it", "s": 38.97}, {"w": "happening", "s": 39.35}, {"w": "here.", "s": 39.74}]}, {"start": 40.47, "end": 42.01, "text": "That answer isn’t marked.", "words": [{"w": "That", "s": 40.47}, {"w": "answer", "s": 40.86}, {"w": "isn’t", "s": 41.24}, {"w": "marked.", "s": 41.63}]}, {"start": 42.36, "end": 46.59, "text": "You can’t mark someone wrong on something you never told them.", "words": [{"w": "You", "s": 42.36}, {"w": "can’t", "s": 42.75}, {"w": "mark", "s": 43.13}, {"w": "someone", "s": 43.52}, {"w": "wrong", "s": 43.9}, {"w": "on", "s": 44.28}, {"w": "something", "s": 44.67}, {"w": "you", "s": 45.05}, {"w": "never", "s": 45.44}, {"w": "told", "s": 45.82}, {"w": "them.", "s": 46.21}]}, {"start": 46.94, "end": 49.63, "text": "The feedback simply gives them the rule.", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 46.94}, {"w": "feedback", "s": 47.33}, {"w": "simply", "s": 47.71}, {"w": "gives", "s": 48.1}, {"w": "them", "s": 48.48}, {"w": "the", "s": 48.87}, {"w": "rule.", "s": 49.25}]}, {"start": 49.98, "end": 57.68, "text": "Chinese works the same way, and the rule’s even simpler: country plus the word for “person” gives you the nationality.", "words": [{"w": "Chinese", "s": 49.98}, {"w": "works", "s": 50.37}, {"w": "the", "s": 50.75}, {"w": "same", "s": 51.14}, {"w": "way,", "s": 51.52}, {"w": "and", "s": 51.91}, {"w": "the", "s": 52.29}, {"w": "rule’s", "s": 52.68}, {"w": "even", "s": 53.06}, {"w": "simpler:", "s": 53.45}, {"w": "country", "s": 53.83}, {"w": "plus", "s": 54.22}, {"w": "the", "s": 54.6}, {"w": "word", "s": 54.98}, {"w": "for", "s": 55.37}, {"w": "“person”", "s": 55.75}, {"w": "gives", "s": 56.14}, {"w": "you", "s": 56.52}, {"w": "the", "s": 56.91}, {"w": "nationality.", "s": 57.29}]}, {"start": 58.03, "end": 60.33, "text": "China gives you “a Chinese person.”", "words": [{"w": "China", "s": 58.03}, {"w": "gives", "s": 58.41}, {"w": "you", "s": 58.8}, {"w": "“a", "s": 59.18}, {"w": "Chinese", "s": 59.57}, {"w": "person.”", "s": 59.95}]}, {"start": 60.68, "end": 62.99, "text": "Britain gives you “a British person.”", "words": [{"w": "Britain", "s": 60.68}, {"w": "gives", "s": 61.07}, {"w": "you", "s": 61.45}, {"w": "“a", "s": 61.84}, {"w": "British", "s": 62.22}, {"w": "person.”", "s": 62.61}]}, {"start": 63.34, "end": 64.11, "text": "Then: Luxembourg?", "words": [{"w": "Then:", "s": 63.34}, {"w": "Luxembourg?", "s": 63.73}]}, {"start": 64.46, "end": 66.77, "text": "Same pattern, and here’s the answer.", "words": [{"w": "Same", "s": 64.46}, {"w": "pattern,", "s": 64.85}, {"w": "and", "s": 65.23}, {"w": "here’s", "s": 65.62}, {"w": "the", "s": 66.0}, {"w": "answer.", "s": 66.38}]}, {"start": 67.12, "end": 72.89, "text": "That helps me see whether learners have understood the rule or simply memorised the examples.", "words": [{"w": "That", "s": 67.12}, {"w": "helps", "s": 67.5}, {"w": "me", "s": 67.89}, {"w": "see", "s": 68.27}, {"w": "whether", "s": 68.66}, {"w": "learners", "s": 69.04}, {"w": "have", "s": 69.43}, {"w": "understood", "s": 69.81}, {"w": "the", "s": 70.2}, {"w": "rule", "s": 70.58}, {"w": "or", "s": 70.97}, {"w": "simply", "s": 71.35}, {"w": "memorised", "s": 71.73}, {"w": "the", "s": 72.12}, {"w": "examples.", "s": 72.5}]}]}